{
  "about": "Prelegal assistant evaluation set: 45 graded questions in 7 groups. The interviewer is graded on what it saved to the document; Ask Prelegal on its reply. Matching ignores case, commas, dollar signs and dash styles; numbers match whole (49 does not match 249). See eval/README.md for every field.",
